@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Bpo Management System

[*] --> SelectFilterCategory
state "Select filter category" as SelectFilterCategory
state "Select price range" as SelectPriceRange
state "Display matching users" as DisplayMatchingUsers

SelectFilterCategory --> SelectPriceRange : select a filter category
SelectPriceRange --> SelectFilterCategory : select a price range
SelectPriceRange --> DisplayMatchingUsers : display matching users based on the chosen criteria

@enduml
